{
  "body_human_readable": "Here are the real GDP growth estimates and projections for 2023 and 2024 for India, China, Brazil, Japan, and the United States according to the IMF World Economic Outlook Update (January 2025):\n\n- **India:**  \n  - 2023: 8.2%  \n  - 2024: 6.5%  \n  - 2025: 6.5% (projection; for reference)  \n  (Note: Data is on a fiscal year basis)  \n- **China:**  \n  - 2023: 5.2%  \n  - 2024: 4.8%  \n  - 2025: 4.6% (projection; for reference)  \n- **Brazil:**  \n  - 2023: 3.2%  \n  - 2024: 3.7%  \n  - 2025: 2.2% (projection; for reference)  \n- **Japan:**  \n  - 2023: 1.5%  \n  - 2024: \u20130.2%  \n  - 2025: 1.1% (projection; for reference)  \n- **United States:**  \n  - 2023: 2.9%  \n  - 2024: 2.8%  \n  - 2025: 2.7% (projection; for reference)  \n\nThese are year-over-year real GDP growth rates in percent.[1]",
  "request": {
